Short:        LibraryTimer assembler source
Author:       jskov@cs.auc.dk (Jesper Skov)
Uploader:     jskov cs auc dk (Jesper Skov)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      38.1 (25.09.93)
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is the source code for an old program I made - the LibraryTimer -
which is able to measure time-usage of library functions.
The archive with the binary can be found in dev/misc.

The source lacks a few macros, so you would probably have to hack your
way through the assembly. Good luck :)

-- Jesper (14.06.97)
